<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-sĕro</span></b> ,
			sēvi, sĭtum, 3, v. a.
		1. sero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to sow</i>, <i>plant</i>, or <i>set between</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malleolum vitibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 16, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 9, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pomis intersita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1377</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			With <i>se</i> or <i>pass.</i>, <i>to come between</i>, <i>lie
			between</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si se vallis interserat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Aug. 11, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nullis ossibus spinisve intersitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 15, 17, § 45</span></i>
			.—Hence, P. a., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intersĭtus</span></b> , a, um,
				<i>put between</i>, <i>interposed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quatuor venti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					2, 22</span></i>
			: area vacanti intersita, Gall. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 16,
				5, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p.
		301</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
